anim idle
frame upper rags legs_idle blade_rest@18,15
frame upper rags_b legs_idle blade_rest@18,15

anim walk
frame upper rags legs_walk1 blade_rest@18,15
frame upper rags_b legs_walk_mid1 blade_rest@18,15
frame upper rags_b legs_walk2 blade_rest@18,15
frame upper rags legs_walk3 blade_rest@18,15
frame upper rags legs_walk_mid2 blade_rest@18,15
frame upper rags_b legs_walk4 blade_rest@18,15

anim windup
frame upper rags legs_idle blade_up@18,-4
frame upper rags legs_idle blade_up@18,-10

anim strike
frame upper rags legs_idle blade_strike@20,8
frame upper rags legs_idle blade_strike@20,11

anim hit
frame upper rags_b legs_walk2 blade_rest@10,20
frame upper rags legs_idle blade_rest@14,17
